        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Acu-Seeds_21949.jpg",
        "title": "About Us",
        "htags": "h2",
        "dhsize": 64,
        "mhsize": 32,
        "content": "<p>At <strong>East Healing</strong>, we believe that true wellness is achieved by harmonizing the mind, body, and spirit. Rooted in the timeless wisdom of Chinese medicine, our premium products are thoughtfully crafted to enhance your mental and physical well-being. Formerly known as <strong>Acu Seeds</strong>, we are proud to evolve into a luxurious destination for holistic health enthusiasts in the UK and beyond.<br/><br/>Our curated collection of acupressure products blends traditional healing practices with modern elegance. From our hero product, the ear seeds, to our innovative acupressure rings and combs, each item is designed to bring you closer to balance and tranquility. Backed by the trust of discerning customers and the endorsement of <strong>Steven Bartlett from Dragons' Den</strong>, East Healing is committed to providing you with a unique journey to wellness—one that is both ancient and beautifully contemporary.</p>",
        "dcsize": 16,
        "mcsize": 16,
        "hcolor": "#695450",
        "ccolor": "#695450",
        "bgimage": "shopify://shop_images/page-banner-background.png",
